		<RichText x="1410" y="223" width="423" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">锚定者侧方向使用巨锚猛击，造成<span color="#7fbfff">60%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="447" width="398" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">距离较远时，锚定者举着锚飞过来下砸，造成<span color="#7fbfff">80%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="671" width="423" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">「奋勇」状态下特定技能结束或处于侧后方时，锚定者翘起尾部，转身横扫一次，接触造成<span color="#7fbfff">75%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="895" width="423" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">「奋勇」状态下，锚定者用力挥舞巨锚进行连续5段的攻击，依次造成<span color="#7fbfff">50%,<br/>50%,50%,50%,75%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1119" width="441" height="172" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">锚定者会不间断进行「小酌」或「酣饮」，增加自身的<span textDecoration="underline">「豪意值」</span><span>。该值满时，锚定者会进入「奋勇」状态，持续</span><span color="#ffdfbf">80s</span><span>，该状态下豪意值会不断衰减，清空时会中断当前动作并退出「奋勇」。受到</span><span color="#ffacff">雷元素伤害</span><span>时，豪意值会额外减少。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="899" y="62" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#2c62d3" width="207" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#2c62d3">制图@Csxylic米游社</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="223" width="399" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">锚定者使用巨锚挥舞两下，依次造成<span color="#7fbfff">40%,40%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="447" width="423" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">距离较近时，锚定者举起巨锚，进行一次下砸，造成<span color="#7fbfff">70%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="671" width="437" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">「奋勇」状态下距离较远时，锚定者握拳飞过来猛击，造成<span color="#7fbfff">100%</span><span>伤害，一般后随「归涛奏溯」。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="895" width="424" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">「奋勇」状态下距离较远时，锚定者喷射水流从下往上扫，造成<span color="#7fbfff">60%</span><span>伤害，水注留下一些泉眼，一段时间后喷发造成</span><span color="#7fbfff">40%</span><span>伤害。一般后随「归涛奏溯」。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
