		<RichText x="66" y="1100" width="443" height="193" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">豪意值：上限<span color="#ffdfbf">600</span><span>点，每次「小酌」至多</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+49%</span><span>(294)， 「酣饮」至多</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+96%</span><span>(576)；当进入「奋勇」状态时，该值每秒</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-7.5</span><span>，持续约</span><span color="#ffdfbf">80s</span><span>。若受</span><span color="#bfccff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响，豪意值积累效率变为</span><span color="#ffbfbf">75%</span><span>，则「小酌」与「酣饮」分别</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+42%</span><span>(252)/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+72%</span><span>(432)。</span><span color="#ffdfbf">(仅大世界)</span><span>当退出「奋勇」状态时，积累效率为</span><span color="#ffbfbf">30%</span><span>，即「小酌」与「酣饮」分别</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+14.7%</span><span>(88.2)/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+28.8%</span><span>(172.8)，受</span><span color="#bfccff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响变为</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+11.025%</span><span>(66.15)/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+21.6%</span><span>(129.6)。<br/>位于深渊内时，开局饮用均为「酣饮」。「奋勇」状态下受到</span><span color="#ffdfbf">无附着雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">n单位雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#dfbfff">星超导雷伤</span><span>时</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-4</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-10n</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-50</span><span>点豪意值。<br/></span><span color="#ffdfbf">(仅深渊)</span><span>「奋勇」状态下攻击力</span><span color="#ffdfbf">提升25%</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
