		<RichText x="1410" y="1119" width="435" height="172" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">锚定者拥有隐性「麻痹值」，上限<span color="#ffdfbf">90</span><span>点(「奋勇」状态</span><span color="#ffdfbf">45点</span><span>)，当锚定者受到</span><span color="#ffdfbf">无附着雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">n单位雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#dfbfff">星超导雷伤</span><span>害时，麻痹值增加</span><span color="#ffdfbf">0.8</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">2n</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">10</span><span>点。当麻痹值达上限时，会麻痹并中断当前动作，随后清空并重置「酒酣仗胆」饮用CD。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
